*.*
!Dockerfile*
!.gitattributes
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
!*.md
!*.sh
!*.ps1
!*.cmd
!*.bat
!*.yml
!*.yaml
!.github/
!.github/**

# The ffmpeg flag/codec lists are layered as <base>.<platform> and <base>.<arch>
# (common/ffmpeg-features.sh reads them), so the names carry a dot and the `*.*`
# rule above would swallow them -- exactly like it already would for
# Linux/common/qtfeatures.release. Without these, CI fails with
# "ffmpeg_features: missing common/ffmpeg-features.linux".
!common/ffmpeg-features.*
!common/media-deps-codecs.*


